    "created_at": "2017-01-05T08:30:36Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-01-05T08:30:36Z",
    "body": "The problem is indeed that whatever defines the CSS rendering tree needs to also define top layers. Having Fullscreen monkey patch CSS is not a good solution. Unfortunately, I believe nobody in the CSS WG is working on that. @tabatkins @fantasai?",
