    "created_at": "2017-01-06T21:04:16Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-01-06T21:04:16Z",
    "body": "Right, this should be part of the Position spec, but MS dropped it and I haven't had the opportunity to really work on it.\r\n\r\nWhat needs to happen, roughly, is that things put into the top layer need to be reparented in the box tree to be children of the root layer (not root element), or something like that, to get the right stacking/filtering/containing behavior. Then they just render in the top layer, which is \"above\" all normal content.",
